# 6. Make sure FormsModule is imported

Since you use:

```html
[(ngModel)]
```

your `app.module.ts` needs:

```ts
import { FormsModule } from '@angular/forms';
```

and:

```ts
imports: [
  BrowserModule,
  FormsModule
]
```

For your **current module-based project**, you already have `FormsModule`, so don't add it again.

